<div class="default_heading">
	<div class="container search_container">
		<div class="row justify-content-between">
			<h1>Widgets</h1>
		</div>
		<h6>These widgets allow other websites to iframe in results from WescomPhotos.com...</h6>
	</div>

</div>

<div class="default_block" >

	<h5>Example iframe:</h5>
	<p>
		<i><small>&lt;iframe src="https://bulletin.wescomphotos.com/widgets/story_images?category=sports&quantity=3" 
		style="width: 800px; height: 410px"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;</small></i>
	</p>
	<iframe src="http://bulletin.wescomphotos.com/widgets/story_images?category=sports&quantity=3" style="width: 800px; height: 410px;"></iframe>

	<hr/>

	<h5>Story Image Widget</h5>
	<p>/widgets/story-images</p>

	Parameters available: 
	<ul>
		<li>search_query = text to search for within image captions</li>
		<li>story_id = story_id</li>
		<li>pubdate = publication date MM-DD-YYYY</li>
		<li>category = story category or subcategory</li>
		<li>quantity = number of story images to show</li>
	</ul>
	
	<p>
		Example: 
		<a href="https://bulletin.wescomphotos.com/widgets/story_images?category=sports&quantity=6">
			bulletin.wescomphotos.com/widgets/story_images?category=sports&quantity=6
		</a>
	</p>
	
	<hr/>
	
	<h5>PDF Image Widget</h5>
	<p>/widgets/pdf_images</p>

	Parameters available: 
	<ul>
		<li>search_query = text to search for within PDF</li>
		<li>pubname = name of publication</li>
		<li>pubdate = publication date MM-DD-YYYY</li>
		<li>section = section letter of publication</li>
		<li>page = page number</li>
		<li>quantity = number of pdf images to show</li>
	</ul>
	
	<p>
		Example: 
		<a href="https://bulletin.wescomphotos.com/widgets/pdf_images?pubname=The%20Bulletin&quantity=3&page=1">
			bulletin.wescomphotos.com/widgets/pdf_images?pubname=The%20Bulletin&quantity=3&page=1
		</a>
	</p>
</div>